    },
    {
      "key": "R01",
      "findings": "Retailer review junip:13200181, actor 215817888, published 2026-05-10T02:01:45.837Z; Softwear–Void, version unknown. Repeated lid loosening and work-pocket seepage stained underwear, shirt and jeans; lost product could not be returned to package. Loves favorite Void and explicitly will repurchase despite cost/loss frustration; suggests click-lock or doe-foot, neither implemented. Three stars, would_recommend=true, verified buyer, unrewarded. Engagement/capture time unavailable; metadata is not an acquisition narration. Different use condition/product scope from unidentified TikTok arrival complaints; cross-venue actor overlap unresolved."
    }
